validation_config.query:
SELECT COUNT(*) 
FROM cse_key_pairs
WHERE enablement_state = 'disabled';

function.description:
Find a problem by its unique problem number.

The number field is unique and follows the format PRB0000001, PRB0000002, etc.

Example:
{
    "number": "PRB0000001"
}

validation_config.query:
SELECT CASE WHEN EXISTS (
                      SELECT 1 FROM virtual_event_townhall_coorganizers co
                      JOIN virtual_event_townhalls v ON v.id = co.townhall_id
                      WHERE v.display_name = 'Acme Q4 Strategy Review'
                      AND co.user_id = 'john.davis'
                    ) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END;

